<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: archotech emanation -->
  <PsychicArchotechEmanator_Core.stages.archotech_emanation-0.label>emanação arcotec</PsychicArchotechEmanator_Core.stages.archotech_emanation-0.label>
  <!-- EN: The scale of it. The fractal logic-scape of the multiversal hyperplane. No distance. No time. No me or them. I'm everything. I'm nothing. -->
  <PsychicArchotechEmanator_Core.stages.archotech_emanation-0.description>A escala disto. A paisagem lógica fractal do hiperplano multiversal. Sem distância. Sem tempo. Sem eu nem eles. Sou tudo. Não sou nada.</PsychicArchotechEmanator_Core.stages.archotech_emanation-0.description>
  <!-- EN: archotech emanation -->
  <PsychicArchotechEmanator_Core.stages.archotech_emanation-1.label>emanação arcotec</PsychicArchotechEmanator_Core.stages.archotech_emanation-1.label>
  <!-- EN: I can feel the edge of its thoughts, see the endless scope when I close my eyes. I need to focus on my physical body or I drift away. -->
  <PsychicArchotechEmanator_Core.stages.archotech_emanation-1.description>Sinto a orla dos seus pensamentos, vejo o alcance infinito quando fecho os olhos. Tenho de me concentrar no meu corpo físico ou deixo-me levar.</PsychicArchotechEmanator_Core.stages.archotech_emanation-1.description>
  
  <!-- EN: archotech emanation -->
  <PsychicArchotechEmanator_Grand.stages.archotech_emanation-0.label>emanação arcotec</PsychicArchotechEmanator_Grand.stages.archotech_emanation-0.label>
  <!-- EN: It makes me perceive so much. Eyeless knowledge of absolute existence, all minds speaking and dying and birthing at once. It's hard not to lose connection with myself. -->
  <PsychicArchotechEmanator_Grand.stages.archotech_emanation-0.description>Faz-me perceber tanto. Conhecimento sem olhos da existência absoluta, todas as mentes a falar, a morrer e a nascer ao mesmo tempo. É difícil não perder a ligação a mim próprio.</PsychicArchotechEmanator_Grand.stages.archotech_emanation-0.description>
  <!-- EN: archotech emanation -->
  <PsychicArchotechEmanator_Grand.stages.archotech_emanation-1.label>emanação arcotec</PsychicArchotechEmanator_Grand.stages.archotech_emanation-1.label>
  <!-- EN: It pays no attention to me but I sense the edge of its perception. Flashes of terrifying timeless sight. Hard to ignore. -->
  <PsychicArchotechEmanator_Grand.stages.archotech_emanation-1.description>Não me presta atenção, mas sinto a orla da sua perceção. Clarões de uma visão aterradora e intemporal. É difícil ignorar.</PsychicArchotechEmanator_Grand.stages.archotech_emanation-1.description>
  
  <!-- EN: archotech emanation -->
  <PsychicArchotechEmanator_Major.stages.archotech_emanation-0.label>emanação arcotec</PsychicArchotechEmanator_Major.stages.archotech_emanation-0.label>
  <!-- EN: These thoughts coming from the structure, they open doors to such vastness... I feel so small that I might disappear. -->
  <PsychicArchotechEmanator_Major.stages.archotech_emanation-0.description>Estes pensamentos vindos da estrutura abrem portas para tal vastidão... Sinto-me tão pequeno que posso desaparecer.</PsychicArchotechEmanator_Major.stages.archotech_emanation-0.description>
  <!-- EN: archotech emanation -->
  <PsychicArchotechEmanator_Major.stages.archotech_emanation-1.label>emanação arcotec</PsychicArchotechEmanator_Major.stages.archotech_emanation-1.label>
  <!-- EN: I can feel the edge of its wordless whispers... They make me uneasy. -->
  <PsychicArchotechEmanator_Major.stages.archotech_emanation-1.description>Sinto a orla dos seus sussurros sem palavras... Deixam-me inquieto.</PsychicArchotechEmanator_Major.stages.archotech_emanation-1.description>
  
</LanguageData>